If FluxCD and monitoring are both enabled
(:ref:`configuration-options.yk8s.k8s-service-layer.fluxcd.enabled`
and
:ref:`configuration-options.yk8s.kubernetes.monitoring.enabled`),
Flux is now hooked up to the Prometheus stack.
kube-state-metrics exports the state of the Flux resources
(as metric ``gotk_resource_info``).
